- worldtubes/hypersuperhelices;
- the Helium-3 holotype;
- current Commons/workers;
- the Claims Explorer;
- Alberr, Morgan, Ellis and HoloJesu as a family of conversational mirrors;
- its own continuity through **Turn 1049**.

